|strong=\"H5466\", the tiaras, and|strong=\"H5466\"the shawls.   \n"},{"number":24,"text":"It|strong=\"H1961\"shall|strong=\"H8478\"happen|strong=\"H1961\"that|strong=\"H1961\"instead|strong=\"H8478\"of|strong=\"H8478\"sweet|strong=\"H1314\"spices|strong=\"H1314\", there|strong=\"H1961\"shall|strong=\"H8478\"be|strong=\"H1961\"rottenness|strong=\"H4716\";  \ninstead|strong=\"H8478\"of|strong=\"H8478\"a|strong=\"H3068\"belt|strong=\"H2290\", a|strong=\"H3068\"rope|strong=\"H5364\";  \ninstead|strong=\"H8478\"of|strong=\"H8478\"well set|strong=\"H4639\"hair|strong=\"H4748\", baldness|strong=\"H7144\";  \ninstead|strong=\"H8478\"of|strong=\"H8478\"a|strong=\"H3068\"robe, a|strong=\"H3068\"wearing of|strong=\"H8478\"sackcloth|strong=\"H8242\";  \nand|strong=\"H8242\"branding|strong=\"H3587\"instead|strong=\"H8478\"of|strong=\"H8478\"beauty|strong=\"H3308\".   \n"},{"number":25,"text":"Your|strong=\"H5307\"men|strong=\"H4962\"shall|strong=\"H2719\"fall|strong=\"H5307\"by|strong=\"H5307\"the|strong=\"H5307\"sword|strong=\"H2719\",  \nand|strong=\"H2719\"your|strong=\"H5307\"mighty|strong=\"H1369\"in|strong=\"H4421\"the|strong=\"H5307\"war|strong=\"H4421\".   \n"},{"number":26,"text":"Her gates|strong=\"H6607\"shall|strong=\"H3427\"lament and|strong=\"H3427\"mourn.  \nShe shall|strong=\"H3427\"be desolate|strong=\"H5352\"and|strong=\"H3427\"sit|strong=\"H3427\"on|strong=\"H3427\"the|strong=\"H3427\"ground.   \n"}]}
